#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""preen — call-site relation to a default, constructed not signed.

A slot with a default is not a value. Two calls that both result in 0.45
are different objects: one omitted the argument (TACIT, rides a future
default change) and one restated 0.45 (SHADOW, will not follow).

Unfold reads the *constructed* nested default, not the type's init
signature: PinProfile's `thresholds: Thresholds = Thresholds(driftDelay: 20)`
inhabits OVERRIDE 20, not TACIT 15.

Clap TACIT is an invocation that omitted `--flag`, not a command-shaped
line. Comments and `.contains("kebab")` are not riders.

    TACIT     omitted; inherits the current default
    SHADOW    passed a literal equal to the default
    OVERRIDE  passed a literal different from the default
    BOUND     passed a non-literal (name, expression, collection)

Diff mode names the blast of a default change:

    BLAST   TACIT on a slot whose default moved (or was born)
    FOSSIL  still passes the old default
    PRE     already restates the new default
    LOCK    passes some other literal
    BOUND   passes an expression
"""
